"Se concede": "Granted",
"Se desliza por terreno seguro y limpia": "Glides over safe terrain and clears slow. Leaves a water curtain that damages and slows. Doesn't cross walls or voids.",
"Se desplaza en arco alrededor del punto elegido dejando una estela que añade Masa. Al cerrar la órbita gana +{n}% de daño {n} s.": "Moves in an arc around the chosen point leaving a trail that adds Mass. Closing the orbit grants +{n}% damage for {n} s.",
