"Se envuelve en yogur protector": "Wraps itself in protective yogurt: gains a shield and clears its slow.",
"Se fusiona con un aliado:": "Fuses with an ally: they receive big healing, much more damage, attack speed and resistance, and have their abilities refreshed almost instantly while it lasts",
"Se gana · Arena Divina: Derribá el castillo enemigo de la Arena Divina.": "Earned · Divine Arena: Bring down the enemy castle in the Divine Arena.",
