"Set de Lucifer": "Lucifer's Set",
"Sets sin skin todavía": "Sets without a skin yet (art pending, see docs/assets_faltantes/skins_sets/): Gravedigger's Requiem · Berserker's Blood · Guardian's Oath · Hunter's Shadow · Eye of the Arcane · King of the Labyrinth · Noon Blueprints · Dusk Carapace · Gala Performance · Celestial Letter · Inner Rampart · Keys of the Threshold · Herald's Plumage. With the full set its full aura shows.",
"Señor de las Polillas": "Lord of the Moths",
