"SALIR DE LA SALA": "LEAVE ROOM",
"Torres y cristal": "Towers and crystal",
"Tu horda sale sola por los tres carriles. Acompañala y derribá torres.": "Your horde sets out on its own down the three lanes. Go along with it and bring down towers.",
