"Anuncia la mañana aunque falten horas. A veces, eso alcanza para aguantar.": "It announces the morning even when hours remain. Sometimes that is enough to hold on.",
"Arco de la Luna Roja": "Red Moon Bow",
"Arrancada de la cresta del Soberano de Hielo. Todavía está fría al tacto, aunque la dejes al sol.": "Torn from the crest of the Ice Sovereign. It is still cold to the touch, even if you leave it in the sun.",
