"Máscara del Acecho": "Mask of the Stalk",
"Nadie cae mientras quede uno de pie que lo haya jurado.": "No one falls while one who swore it still stands.",
"No persigue a la manada. Persigue al que la guía.": "It doesn't chase the herd. It chases the one who leads it.",
"ONDA COLOSAL: el daño que mitigás o absorbés se acumula. Al llegar al {n}% de tu vida, liberás una onda que daña y aturde enemigos y escuda a los aliados cercanos.": "COLOSSAL WAVE: the damage you mitigate or absorb builds up. At {n}% of your health, you release a wave that damages and stuns enemies and shields nearby allies.",
"Ojo del Arcano": "Eye of the Arcane",
"Orbe del Arcano": "Orb of the Arcane",
"PRESA MARCADA: golpear un élite/subjefe/jefe lo marca. Golpearlo seguido acumula Concentración (hasta {n}): +{n}% crítico y +{n}% daño crítico por carga. Cambiar de objetivo la reduce a la mitad.": "MARKED PREY: hitting an elite/sub-boss/boss marks it. Hitting it repeatedly builds Focus (up to {n}): +{n}% crit and +{n}% crit damage per charge. Switching targets halves it.",
