"Esbirro. Llegan de a tres; si hay un brasero encendido cerca, lo rodean y le roban el calor. Si no, revolotean alrededor del guardián y pican de a una.": "Minion. They arrive in threes; if a brazier is lit nearby, they surround it and steal its heat. If not, they flutter around the guardian and sting one at a time.",
"Escarcha Paralizante": "Paralyzing Frost",
"Escarcha Paralizante — Los enemigos muy cerca del centro de la Nova de Escarcha quedan brevemente aturdidos, no solo lentos.": "Paralyzing Frost — Enemies very near the center of the Frost Nova are briefly stunned, not just slowed.",
